<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Auto Taming using normal scroll of taming and powerful scroll of taming</Major>
    <Description>Must zoom out for you to be able to see multiple mobs to activate the "Press TAB to select enemies"

How to use:
1. Make sure you have the option to select enemy using TAB.
2. Put the attack button in the #1 key in your skill tab.
3. Put the Powerful Scroll or Normal scroll of taming in the #2 key in your skill tab.
4. Go to the taming spot and make sure you have all the materials needed for taming. Enjoy!!! </Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 43 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 43 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 31 1
Delay 500 ms
KeyUp 31 1
Delay 500 ms
KeyDown 30 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 30 1
Delay 64
GoWhile 1 9999</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Rappelz</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>